    "Infested tools or machinery",
    "Planting infected seedlings"
  ],
  "management": [
    "Use resistant or tolerant cultivars",
    "Remove and destroy infected plants",
    "Improve soil drainage and avoid waterlogging",
    "Practice crop rotation with non-hosts"
  ],
